  "rationale": "Keep the original pinned checkout immutable. Build only a private tracked-file stage; replace wall-clock/network version generation with declared metadata and the pinned commit epoch. Abort hash maintenance on non-24-byte keys before copying into the hash data array. Replace NetworkUtil's variable-length address buffer with the constant IPv6 maximum, retaining the selected IPv4/IPv6 inet_ntop length. Preserve strict compiler warnings. Count zero is declared policy, not mutable history depth."
